#: ../../learn/application.rst:2
msgid "Integrate an application"
msgstr "集成到应用"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:4
msgid "Zett Agent supplies the model/tool loop. Your application supplies the UI, authentication, session routing, resource lifetime, and policies. This guide shows the boundaries to handle when moving from a script to a service."
msgstr "Zett Agent 提供模型/工具循环，界面、身份认证、会话路由、资源生命周期和各项策略则由你的应用负责。本页说明从脚本走向服务时需要处理哪些边界。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:9
msgid "Choose a calling style"
msgstr "选择调用方式"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:11
msgid "Three ways to consume a request"
msgstr "消费请求的三种方式"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:15
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:16
msgid "Use it when"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:17
msgid "``await client.run(...)``"
msgstr "``await client.run(...)``"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:18
msgid "You need the final answer. A bound dispatcher still receives progress."
msgstr "你需要最终答案。已绑定的分发器仍会收到进度事件。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:19
msgid "``client.stream(...)``"
msgstr "``client.stream(...)``"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:20
msgid "You forward events, stop early, or implement interactive controls."
msgstr "你需要转发事件、提前停止，或者实现交互式控制。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:21
msgid "``create_agent_sync(...)``"
msgstr "``create_agent_sync(...)``"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:22
msgid "Your host is blocking Python code. See :doc:`synchronous`."
msgstr "你的宿主是阻塞式的 Python 代码。参见 :doc:`synchronous`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:24
msgid "For an HTTP stream or WebSocket, translate events into your own wire format. ``AgentEvent`` may carry Python messages, exceptions, or provider payloads; it is not an application-level JSON protocol. Select the fields your UI needs and avoid forwarding secrets or raw exception objects."
msgstr "对于 HTTP 流或 WebSocket，请把事件转换为你自己的传输格式。\\ ``AgentEvent`` 可能携带 Python 消息、异常或模型提供商的载荷，它并不是应用层的 JSON 协议。只挑选界面需要的字段转发，并避免外泄密钥或原始异常对象。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:30
msgid "Set a request deadline"
msgstr "设置请求期限"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:32
msgid "Use ``asyncio.wait_for`` on Python 3.10+ to bound the entire awaited run:"
msgstr "在 Python 3.10+ 上，用 ``asyncio.wait_for`` 为整个被等待的运行设置上限："

#: ../../learn/application.rst:45
msgid "Timeout cancels unfinished work and waits for cancellation cleanup. Cleanup can make total elapsed time longer than the deadline. Provider retries and tool waits consume that same deadline; ``max_iterations`` is not a timeout."
msgstr "超时会取消尚未完成的工作，并等待取消清理结束。清理可能让总耗时超过期限。模型提供商的重试和工具等待同样占用这个期限；``max_iterations`` 并不是超时设置。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:49
msgid "Cancellation is not rollback. A tool may already have changed an external system, and a synchronous function running in a worker thread cannot be forcibly stopped by cancelling its awaiter. Give mutating tools their own timeouts, transaction rules, and idempotency controls. Never automatically replay a whole request just because the connection to the UI closed."
msgstr "取消并不等于回滚。工具可能已经改动了外部系统，而运行在工作线程中的同步函数无法通过取消它的等待者被强制停止。请为会修改状态的工具单独设置超时、事务规则和幂等控制。绝不要仅仅因为界面连接断开就自动重放整个请求。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:56
msgid "Close streams on disconnect"
msgstr "断开连接时关闭流"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:66
msgid "``send_to_ui`` is your application transport. If it raises on disconnect, the context manager closes the unfinished request. The same cleanup happens when the loop exits early. In a web framework, propagate request cancellation instead of leaving detached generation tasks running accidentally."
msgstr "``send_to_ui`` 是你自己的应用传输层。如果它在连接断开时抛出异常，上下文管理器会关闭这个尚未完成的请求。循环提前退出时也会进行同样的清理。在 Web 框架中，请传播请求取消，而不要任其留下脱离的生成任务意外运行。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:71
msgid "A dispatcher attached to this client is called **before** the event is yielded. Do not dispatch the event again yourself. Callbacks are awaited in order and can slow generation; use a bounded queue for slow sinks. For a GUI, schedule widget updates on the GUI thread rather than touching them from async or background-loop callbacks."
msgstr "挂在这个客户端上的分发器会在事件产出 **之前** 被调用。不要自己再次分发该事件。回调按顺序等待执行，可能拖慢生成速度；对于较慢的输出端，请使用有界队列。对于 GUI，请把控件更新调度到 GUI 线程上执行，而不是在异步或后台循环的回调中直接操作控件。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:78
msgid "Distinguish failure boundaries"
msgstr "区分失败边界"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:80
msgid "What ends the request?"
msgstr "什么会终止请求？"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:84
msgid "Situation"
msgstr "情况"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:85
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:86
msgid "A tool handler raises an ordinary exception"
msgstr "工具处理函数抛出普通异常"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:87
msgid "Emits ``TOOL_FAILED`` and gives the model an unsuccessful tool result. The model can continue."
msgstr "发出 ``TOOL_FAILED`` 事件，并向模型返回一个不成功的工具结果。模型可以继续运行。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:88
msgid "Provider, protocol, lifecycle hook, or callback fails"
msgstr "模型提供商、协议、生命周期钩子或回调失败"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:89
msgid "Propagates the exception. Do not assume a ``RUN_COMPLETED`` event will arrive."
msgstr "向外传播该异常。不要假设一定会收到 ``RUN_COMPLETED`` 事件。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:90
msgid "Request is cancelled or stream closes early"
msgstr "请求被取消或流提前关闭"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:91
msgid "Cancels unfinished work and releases the session. No successful final answer is synthesized."
msgstr "取消尚未完成的工作并释放会话。不会合成成功的最终答案。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:92
msgid "Model-call budget is exhausted"
msgstr "模型调用预算耗尽"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:93
msgid "Raises ``AgentIterationLimitError``. Use a new user request only after deciding how to handle partial work."
msgstr "抛出 ``AgentIterationLimitError``\\ 。只有在决定如何处理未完成的工作之后，才能使用新的用户请求。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:95
msgid "Close loading indicators in ``finally``. Preserve cancellation when handling errors: do not convert ``CancelledError`` into an ordinary successful reply. For user-visible errors, show a safe message and keep detailed diagnostics in an access-controlled sink. Exceptions from tool handlers are visible to the model as text; sanitize them before they leave sensitive integrations."
msgstr "在 ``finally`` 中关闭加载指示器。处理错误时要保留取消语义：不要把 ``CancelledError`` 转换成普通的成功回复。对于用户可见的错误，显示一条安全的提示信息，并把详细的诊断信息写入受访问控制的输出目标。工具处理函数抛出的异常会以文本形式对模型可见，因此在离开敏感集成前要对它们做脱敏处理。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:102
msgid "Route concurrent conversations"
msgstr "路由并发对话"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:104
msgid "Different sessions can run concurrently on the same runtime:"
msgstr "不同的会话可以在同一个运行时上并发运行："

#: ../../learn/application.rst:115
msgid "Overlapping requests for **one session** are rejected. Queue them in your application or send supported external input into the active request; do not start a second model loop for that conversation. ``client.agent.is_conflict(id)`` is useful for display, but the runtime's admission check is authoritative. Use ``client.agent.get_state(session_id)`` for inspection rather than the convenience ``state`` view, which reflects the most recently started request."
msgstr "针对 **同一个会话** 的重叠请求会被拒绝。请在你的应用中排队，或者把支持的外部输入发送给正在进行的请求；不要为这个对话再启动第二个模型循环。\\ ``client.agent.is_conflict(id)`` 适合展示，但运行时的准入检查才是权威。检查状态请用 ``client.agent.get_state(session_id)``，而不是便捷的 ``state`` 视图，后者反映的是最近一次启动的请求。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:122
msgid "This guard belongs to one runtime instance. It is not a distributed lock across processes or separate clients. In a multi-worker service, route a session to one active worker or enforce serialization in your application's shared coordination layer. Session IDs are identifiers, not authorization: validate the user's access before running, listing, or deleting a conversation."
msgstr "这层保护只属于单个运行时实例，它不是跨进程或跨客户端的分布式锁。在多工作进程的服务中，请把会话路由到唯一的活动工作进程，或者在应用的共享协调层中强制串行化。会话 ID 只是标识符，不代表授权：在运行、列出或删除某个会话之前，请先校验该用户的访问权限。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:128
msgid "If callbacks serve several sessions, route by ``event.session_id``. Keep extension state request-scoped and make shared tools safe for concurrency; see :doc:`../extending/state` and :doc:`tools`."
msgstr "如果回调要服务多个会话，请按 ``event.session_id`` 进行路由。把扩展状态保持在请求作用域内，并确保共享工具在并发下是安全的；参见 :doc:`../extending/state` 和 :doc:`tools`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:133
msgid "Own resources explicitly"
msgstr "显式管理资源"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:135
msgid "Create providers and durable stores during application startup, keep them open while requests use them, and close them during shutdown:"
msgstr "在应用启动时创建模型提供商和持久化存储，在请求使用期间保持它们打开，并在关闭时关闭它们："

#: ../../learn/application.rst:155
msgid "``model`` is your configured provider; ``serve_application`` is your server's request lifecycle. Shutdown should stop admission and settle active requests before closing their resources. The runtime closes the streams it creates, but it does not close a provider or storage object you supplied. MCP transports are an exception in scope: :doc:`mcp` opens and closes them per request."
msgstr "``model`` 是你配置好的提供商；``serve_application`` 是你服务器的请求生命周期。关闭流程应先停止接纳新请求，并在关闭资源之前处理完正在进行的请求。运行时会关闭它自己创建的流，但不会关闭你提供的提供商或存储对象。MCP 传输在作用域上是例外：:doc:`mcp` 会按请求打开和关闭它们。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:162
msgid "An offline integration example"
msgstr "一个离线集成示例"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:168
msgid "Run ``uv run python docs/_examples/application.py`` from a checkout:"
msgstr "在源码检出目录中运行 ``uv run python docs/_examples/application.py``："

#: ../../learn/application.rst:175
msgid "The :download:`complete program <../_examples/application.py>` verifies independent history and cancellation cleanup without a network request."
msgstr ":download:`完整程序 <../_examples/application.py>` 无需网络请求即可验证独立的历史记录和取消清理。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:179
msgid "Before deployment"
msgstr "部署之前"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:181
msgid "Pin and test the model/endpoint combination your application relies on."
msgstr "锁定并测试你的应用所依赖的模型与端点组合。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:182
msgid "Enforce tool access in code, not only in a prompt; isolate shell and file access."
msgstr "在代码中实施工具访问控制，而不只是写在提示词里；同时隔离 shell 和文件访问。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:183
msgid "Set request deadlines, provider retry policies, and per-tool limits."
msgstr "设置请求期限、模型提供商重试策略和单个工具的限额。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:184
msgid "Serialize each conversation and choose one history-restoring extension."
msgstr "串行化每个对话，并选择一个可恢复历史记录的扩展。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:185
msgid "Decide which prompts, images, results, and traces may be stored or logged."
msgstr "确定哪些提示词、图像、工具结果和追踪数据可以存储或记录日志。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:186
msgid "Test success, tool failure, disconnect, cancellation, and restart restoration."
msgstr "测试成功、工具失败、连接断开、取消以及重启后的恢复。"

#: ../../learn/application.rst:188
msgid "Next: :doc:`testing` for fast regression tests, or :doc:`sessions` for history and retention."
msgstr "下一步：需要快速回归测试请看 :doc:`testing`，需要了解历史记录和保留策略请看 :doc:`sessions`\\ 。"

